{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14161","headline":"汉阴吊崔员外坟 · 戎昱","name":"汉阴吊崔员外坟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"远别望有归，叶落望春晖。\n所痛泉路人，一去无还期。\n荒坟遗汉阴，坟树啼子规。\n存没抱冤滞，孤魂意何依。\n岂无骨肉亲，岂无深相知。\n曝露不复问，高名亦何爲。\n相携恸君罢，春日空迟迟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戎昱","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14161.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14161","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}